# ShopStack Frontend Environment Variables
# In production (e.g. Vercel, Netlify, Render), set this to your deployed Spring Boot backend URL:
# Example: VITE_API_URL=https://your-shopstack-backend.onrender.com/api
# In local development, you can leave it blank (defaults to /api with Vite dev proxy) or set:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8081/api
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8081/api
